<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>entry</key>
	<dict>
		<key>cell</key>
		<string>PSLinkCell</string>
		<key>icon</key>
		<string>icon.png</string>
		<key>label</key>
		<string>Powercuff</string>
	</dict>
	<key>items</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>模拟系统热压力等级，默认关闭。“标称”仍属于模拟；请选择“关闭”退出模拟。可能影响性能和帧率，实际省电效果需实测。安装或升级后请先注销一次。</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>热模拟档位</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>PostNotification</key>
			<string>com.minis.powercuff-baldaran-trusted.settingschanged</string>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSLinkListCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<integer>0</integer>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.minis.powercuff-baldaran-trusted</string>
			<key>detail</key>
			<string>PSListItemsController</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>注销并成功注入后，修改档位通过通知下发。建议从轻度开始测试。</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>PowerMode</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>模拟档位</string>
			<key>validTitles</key>
			<array>
				<string>关闭</string>
				<string>标称（仍在模拟）</string>
				<string>轻度</string>
				<string>中度</string>
				<string>重度</string>
			</array>
			<key>validValues</key>
			<array>
				<integer>0</integer>
				<integer>1</integer>
				<integer>2</integer>
				<integer>3</integer>
				<integer>4</integer>
			</array>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>PostNotification</key>
			<string>com.minis.powercuff-baldaran-trusted.settingschanged</string>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<false/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.minis.powercuff-baldaran-trusted</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>RequireLowPowerMode</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>仅在低电量模式下生效</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>开启此开关后，退出系统低电量模式会请求关闭模拟；再次进入时恢复保存的档位，不会改写档位设置。关闭模拟不等于解除系统真实过热时的保护。</string>
		</dict>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
